  16: -- maps them back in the result. As before, the private-use characters the
  17: -- function uses as markers (U+E000..U+E003) are removed from the source
  18: -- first, so user text cannot forge a highlight or a bracket. Matching,
  19: -- highlighting, fragment choice, and the signature are otherwise unchanged;
  20: -- like any punctuation, a `<` at the very start of a fragment is trimmed by
  21: -- ts_headline.
  22: --
  23: -- Privileges: unchanged (owner postgres; EXECUTE for nobody but the owner;
  24: -- only the definer search RPC calls it); restated below per the PLAN rule.
  25: --
  26: -- Rollback (app first, then):
  27: --   re-run the private.meeting_note_search_headline definition from
