comment on function public.create_meeting_note(uuid, text, timestamptz, text, uuid[]) is
  'Phase 6 T17 (FR-001, BR-002): a member of the space''s company creates a note (title 1-200, not blank, date 
required, content <= 100,000, <= 50 current-member participants) with version 1; company and author snapshots come 
from the space and the caller''s users row. Locks users -> company -> space. Authenticated only.';
comment on function public.search_meeting_notes(text, uuid, boolean, timestamptz, timestamptz, integer, integer) is
  'Company-scoped meeting-note search (T4, FR-026; block A fixes). SECURITY DEFINER; only notes of the caller''s 
users.company_id (resolved from auth.uid()). Phrases and exclusions apply across portuguese/english variants at 
original positions. Excerpt highlights are delimited by U+E000/U+E001.';
comment on function private.meeting_note_search_tsvector(text[], text[]) is
  'Meeting-note search document: each text in portuguese+english unaccented configs, lexemes merged at original 
positions, texts 128 positions apart, weights per text (block A fixes).';
comment on function private.meeting_note_search_headline(text, tsquery) is
  'Meeting-note search excerpt: the first ts_headline (portuguese, english, then any positive query word) that 
highlights a match (block A fixes).';

